  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide fresh water for poor girls in Guatemala</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will fund a pump for a new water well to support 780 girls at our charity girls&apos; school in Guatemala. Well construction is complete and a submersible pump is now essential to extract the fresh water from the borehole for our girls&apos; drinking and sanitation. The school frequently suffers water shortages during the dry season and needs to pay for 3 tons of water weekly. This new well is a cost effective, efficient, sustainable solution for safe drinking water for the poorest girls.</narrative>
  </description>
